  "behavior": [
    "Use both authenticated loaded acknowledgements and the committed party admission as the only point of transition.",
    "Freeze both eligible personal sessions and party admission in one guarded transaction. An empty ordinary charged run refunds energy once. Already paid coins stay paid. Persist only acknowledged loot and results. Normal solo recovery or finish performs the existing idempotent grant.",
